{"resourceIdentifier":"4249","resourceName":"Ordu Landfill Gas to Electricity Project","description":"In order to provide an environmentally friendly and sustainable municipal solid waste management system, Ordu Landfill Gas to Electricity Project is being implemented by Ordu\r\nYenilenebilir Enerji Elektrik Üretim Sanayi ve Ticaret Anonim Şirketi The project is built within the premises of the Ordu Landfill Facility in the Çaybaşı district of Ordu province . The Solid Waste Landfill Site is located on a total area of 132,84 37 m 2 1 The project start date is 24 June 2021 , and w ithin the crediting period between 24 June 2021 and 23 June 202 8 landfill gas is extracted, and electrical energy is obtained. The project activity includes capturing and utilizing landfill gas (landfill gas contains approximately 50 % methane and is a potent greenhouse gas) for power generation, which would have been vented to the atmosphere in the pre project/business as usual scenario. It has been determined that an average of 300 350 tonnes/day of waste will be stored in the landfill . The waste composition that the project receives has 7 8.4 2 organic materials.","location":{"latitude":40.799100,"longitude":37.389900},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-04-05","endExclusive":"2023-05-06","endInclusive":"2023-05-05"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4249"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ordu Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ordu Yenilenebilir Enerji Elektrik Üretim Sanayi ve Ticaret Anonim Şirketi"},{"type":"string","value":"Ankara, Turkey"},{"type":"string","value":"+90 452 600 06 02"},{"type":"string","value":"aykut.guner@orduenerji.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4249"}]